"""TLS/SSL Security, Certificate, and Cipher Suite Analyzer.

Pure-Python implementation assessing transport layer security:
1. X.509 Certificate Deep Inspection (Subject, Issuer, SANs, Dates, Serial, Key, Sig Alg, Chain)
2. Safe Protocol Version Auditing (SSLv2, SSLv3, TLS 1.0, TLS 1.1, TLS 1.2, TLS 1.3)
3. Cryptographic Cipher Suite Strength Auditing (NULL, EXPORT, Anonymous, RC4, 3DES, CBC, Forward Secrecy)
4. Standards-based Severity Evaluation and Remediation Guidance (NIST SP 800-52r2, PCI-DSS, RFC 6125)
"""

